ation, independent of the camera's motion model, but showed less follow-through on the testable parts that don't rely on assumptions like \"pilot comfort rotations\" - Kacey's clap-back was understandable, even if the Bigfoot reply was pretty crass. It's not case closed.</p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<i></i>\n\t\t\t<i></i>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.metabunk.org/threads/kacey-musgraves-ufos-followed-our-plane.14837/post-366844\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t#11\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<p>Why should witnesses who have more data not be asked to share that data?</p><p>\n\nWe can't validate data we don't have, we'd just be open to \"maybe you still got the time wrong\" What is tiresome is reluctance to share details that can help resolve cases, whilst taking time to denigrate those trying to investigate it.</p><p>\n\nTo my view this is solved well enough as the well understood and known phenomenon of Starlink flares and anyone who thinks otherwise is encouraged to \"roll their sleeves up\" and show it by data validation etc.</p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\n\n\t\n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\